# An allowlisted build context excludes operator configuration and credentials.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!.sqlx/
!.sqlx/**
!Dockerfile
# Never import local build output or crash dumps through an allowed directory.
**/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/hs_err_pid*.log
**/replay_pid*.log
**/.git
